" Modal's light theme, after Tokyo Night Day.

highlight background   #e1e2e7
highlight text         #3760bf
highlight dim          #8990b3
highlight accent       #2e7de9
highlight warning      #f52a65
highlight message      #8c6c3e
highlight cursor       #8c6c3e
highlight cursor-text  #e1e2e7
highlight selection    #b7c1e3
highlight playhead     #c5ddb8
highlight bar          #d0d5e3
highlight bar-text     #6172b0
highlight panel        #c4c8da
highlight chrome       #d0d5e3
highlight mode         #2e7de9
highlight mode-text    #e1e2e7
highlight grid-line    #d5d8e2
highlight beat-line    #c4c8da
highlight bar-line     #a8aecb
highlight note         #587539
highlight note-selected #b15c00
highlight label       #b15c00
highlight density-1    #c6d6b1
highlight density-2    #a3c084
highlight density-3    #7c9e5a
highlight density-4    #587539
highlight own-meter    #d6cfe6
highlight hint-key     #587539
highlight hint-group   #9854f1
highlight match        #007197

" Active track toggles, with contrasting text.
highlight track-mute #c25a7c
highlight track-solo #46652b
highlight track-chase #245fb5
highlight track-quantize #387068
highlight track-arm #e00000
highlight track-thru #7a6a00
highlight toggle-text #ffffff
highlight event-sign #9854f1

" A field free text is typed into or chosen from a list, lighter than the background and the panel, as fields
" usually are.
highlight field #f3f4f7

" The status line's indicators: always in their places, dim when off and lit in their own colours
" when on; red for arming, the warm colours for how recording will go, a quiet blue for settings simply on,
" the click among them, as it may be left on all the time.
highlight indicator             #e6e8ef
highlight indicator-text        #9399b8
highlight indicator-lit-text    #ffffff
highlight indicator-arm         #e00000
highlight indicator-record-mode #b15c00
highlight indicator-count       #8c6c3e
highlight indicator-click       #2e7de9
highlight indicator-thru        #2e7de9
highlight indicator-audition    #2e7de9
highlight indicator-rewind      #2e7de9
highlight indicator-input       #587539

" The row above the status line for messages, hints and the : prompt, always there, in the bar's
" colour, so the two rows are one band and only the status line's fields stand out as chips.
highlight message-line #d0d5e3
